{"term": "道", "definition": "万物之本源与运行规律。老子：道可道，非常道。道生一，一生二，二生三，三生万物。", "source": "chinese_classics", "domain": "chinese_philosophy", "lang": "zh"}
{"term": "德", "definition": "道之在物者为德。万物得道而生，德即道之体现与实践。", "source": "chinese_classics", "domain": "chinese_philosophy", "lang": "zh"}
{"term": "仁", "definition": "孔子核心概念。爱人，己欲立而立人，己欲达而达人。克己复礼为仁。", "source": "chinese_classics", "domain": "chinese_philosophy", "lang": "zh"}
{"term": "义", "definition": "行事之宜，当然之则。孟子：义，人之正路也。与利相对。", "source": "chinese_classics", "domain": "chinese_philosophy", "lang": "zh"}
{"term": "礼", "definition": "社会秩序与行为规范的总称。荀子：礼者，养也。分别等级，明确名分。", "source": "chinese_classics", "domain": "chinese_philosophy", "lang": "zh"}
{"term": "智", "definition": "认知与判断能力。孟子四端之一：是非之心，智之端也。", "source": "chinese_classics", "domain": "chinese_philosophy", "lang": "zh"}
{"term": "信", "definition": "诚实守诺。言必信，行必果。五常之一。", "source": "chinese_classics", "domain": "chinese_philosophy", "lang": "zh"}
{"term": "阴阳", "definition": "宇宙万物对立统一的两种基本力量。一阴一阳之谓道。阴阳相推而变化生焉。", "source": "chinese_classics", "domain": "chinese_philosophy", "lang": "zh"}
{"term": "五行", "definition": "金木水火土五种基本元素及其相生相克关系。木生火，火生土，土生金，金生水，水生木。", "source": "chinese_classics", "domain": "chinese_philosophy", "lang": "zh"}
{"term": "太极", "definition": "宇宙万物的本原状态。太极生两仪，两仪生四象，四象生八卦。无极而太极。", "source": "chinese_classics", "domain": "chinese_philosophy", "lang": "zh"}
{"term": "无极", "definition": "太极之前的混沌未分状态。周敦颐：无极而太极。", "source": "chinese_classics", "domain": "chinese_philosophy", "lang": "zh"}
{"term": "气", "definition": "构成万物的基本物质。天地之间，一气耳。气聚则生，气散则死。", "source": "chinese_classics", "domain": "chinese_philosophy", "lang": "zh"}
{"term": "理", "definition": "事物之所以然之故，即事物的本质规律。朱熹：理在事先，理一分殊。", "source": "chinese_classics", "domain": "chinese_philosophy", "lang": "zh"}
{"term": "心", "definition": "心学核心概念。王阳明：心即理也。心外无物，心外无理。", "source": "chinese_classics", "domain": "chinese_philosophy", "lang": "zh"}
{"term": "性", "definition": "人之本性。孟子：性善。荀子：性恶。告子：性无善无不善。", "source": "chinese_classics", "domain": "chinese_philosophy", "lang": "zh"}
{"term": "命", "definition": "天之所赋，不可违抗的必然性。天命之谓性，率性之谓道，修道之谓教。", "source": "chinese_classics", "domain": "chinese_philosophy", "lang": "zh"}
{"term": "天", "definition": "自然之天、主宰之天、义理之天。天行健，君子以自强不息。", "source": "chinese_classics", "domain": "chinese_philosophy", "lang": "zh"}
{"term": "诚", "definition": "真实无妄。中庸：诚者，天之道也；诚之者，人之道也。", "source": "chinese_classics", "domain": "chinese_philosophy", "lang": "zh"}
{"term": "中庸", "definition": "不偏不倚，无过无不及。中者天下之大本，庸者天下之达道。", "source": "chinese_classics", "domain": "chinese_philosophy", "lang": "zh"}
{"term": "格物", "definition": "穷究事物之理。大学八条目之首。朱熹：即物穷理。王阳明：正心之物。", "source": "chinese_classics", "domain": "chinese_philosophy", "lang": "zh"}
{"term": "致知", "definition": "达到真知。大学：致知在格物。王阳明：致良知。", "source": "chinese_classics", "domain": "chinese_philosophy", "lang": "zh"}
{"term": "良知", "definition": "王阳明核心概念。不虑而知，不学而能的本然道德意识。致良知即为圣学。", "source": "chinese_classics", "domain": "chinese_philosophy", "lang": "zh"}
{"term": "知行合一", "definition": "王阳明命题。知之真切笃实处即是行，行之明觉精察处即是知。知行本体不可分离。", "source": "chinese_classics", "domain": "chinese_philosophy", "lang": "zh"}
{"term": "无为", "definition": "老子核心主张。非不做事，而是不妄为、不强为。无为而无不为。", "source": "chinese_classics", "domain": "chinese_philosophy", "lang": "zh"}
{"term": "自然", "definition": "道法自然。事物本来如此的状态，非人为造作。", "source": "chinese_classics", "domain": "chinese_philosophy", "lang": "zh"}
{"term": "有无", "definition": "老子辩证法核心范畴。有无相生，难易相成。天下万物生于有，有生于无。", "source": "chinese_classics", "domain": "chinese_philosophy", "lang": "zh"}
{"term": "虚", "definition": "心之本体空灵明觉。致虚极，守静笃。虚而待物。", "source": "chinese_classics", "domain": "chinese_philosophy", "lang": "zh"}
{"term": "静", "definition": "心之安定不动。归根曰静，静曰复命。动静互根。", "source": "chinese_classics", "domain": "chinese_philosophy", "lang": "zh"}
{"term": "名", "definition": "名称、概念。名可名，非常名。名不正则言不顺。正名是治理之基础。", "source": "chinese_classics", "domain": "chinese_philosophy", "lang": "zh"}
{"term": "实", "definition": "与名相对的实际存在。循名责实，名实相副。", "source": "chinese_classics", "domain": "chinese_philosophy", "lang": "zh"}
{"term": "体用", "definition": "本体与功用。体用不二，即体即用。程朱：理为体，气为用。", "source": "chinese_classics", "domain": "chinese_philosophy", "lang": "zh"}
{"term": "本末", "definition": "根本与枝末。物有本末，事有终始，知所先后，则近道矣。", "source": "chinese_classics", "domain": "chinese_philosophy", "lang": "zh"}
{"term": "经权", "definition": "常道与权变。经者常也，权者变也。经权相济，随时中道。", "source": "chinese_classics", "domain": "chinese_philosophy", "lang": "zh"}
{"term": "忠恕", "definition": "孔子一贯之道。忠：尽己之心。恕：推己及人。己所不欲，勿施于人。", "source": "chinese_classics", "domain": "chinese_philosophy", "lang": "zh"}
{"term": "孝悌", "definition": "孝敬父母，尊敬兄长。仁之本也。百善孝为先。", "source": "chinese_classics", "domain": "chinese_philosophy", "lang": "zh"}
{"term": "四端", "definition": "孟子人性论核心。恻隐之心仁之端，羞恶之心义之端，辞让之心礼之端，是非之心智之端。", "source": "chinese_classics", "domain": "chinese_philosophy", "lang": "zh"}
{"term": "浩然之气", "definition": "孟子概念。至大至刚，以直养而无害，塞于天地之间。配义与道。", "source": "chinese_classics", "domain": "chinese_philosophy", "lang": "zh"}
{"term": "天人合一", "definition": "天道与人道本质统一。人与自然和谐共生。儒道共有的最高理想。", "source": "chinese_classics", "domain": "chinese_philosophy", "lang": "zh"}
{"term": "齐物", "definition": "庄子核心思想。万物齐同，是非无定。以道观之，物无贵贱。", "source": "chinese_classics", "domain": "chinese_philosophy", "lang": "zh"}
{"term": "逍遥", "definition": "庄子最高境界。无待而游，不依赖外物的绝对自由。", "source": "chinese_classics", "domain": "chinese_philosophy", "lang": "zh"}
{"term": "坐忘", "definition": "庄子修养功夫。堕肢体，黜聪明，离形去知，同于大通。", "source": "chinese_classics", "domain": "chinese_philosophy", "lang": "zh"}
{"term": "心斋", "definition": "庄子修心方法。虚者，心斋也。唯道集虚。", "source": "chinese_classics", "domain": "chinese_philosophy", "lang": "zh"}
{"term": "兼爱", "definition": "墨子核心主张。爱无差等，视人之国若视其国，视人之家若视其家。", "source": "chinese_classics", "domain": "chinese_philosophy", "lang": "zh"}
{"term": "法", "definition": "韩非子核心概念。以法治国，法不阿贵。法者，编著之图籍，设之于官府。", "source": "chinese_classics", "domain": "chinese_philosophy", "lang": "zh"}
{"term": "势", "definition": "韩非子概念。权势，位势。法术势三者不可偏废。", "source": "chinese_classics", "domain": "chinese_philosophy", "lang": "zh"}
{"term": "术", "definition": "韩非子概念。君主驾驭臣下的手段和方法。", "source": "chinese_classics", "domain": "chinese_philosophy", "lang": "zh"}
{"term": "空", "definition": "佛教核心概念。诸法皆空，因缘和合。色即是空，空即是色。", "source": "chinese_classics", "domain": "chinese_philosophy", "lang": "zh"}
{"term": "缘起", "definition": "佛教基本教义。此有故彼有，此生故彼生。万法因缘生，因缘灭。", "source": "chinese_classics", "domain": "chinese_philosophy", "lang": "zh"}
{"term": "中道", "definition": "佛教方法论。不落两边，离断常二见。龙树：不生不灭，不常不断，不一不异，不来不出。", "source": "chinese_classics", "domain": "chinese_philosophy", "lang": "zh"}
{"term": "般若", "definition": "佛教智慧概念。超越世俗知识的最高智慧，照见五蕴皆空的洞见。", "source": "chinese_classics", "domain": "chinese_philosophy", "lang": "zh"}
{"term": "理一分殊", "definition": "朱熹命题。天理只有一个，但在万物中各有其殊相。月印万川之喻。", "source": "chinese_classics", "domain": "chinese_philosophy", "lang": "zh"}
